Subject: Accept GD_BICUBIC and GD_BICUBIC_FIXED as interpolation methods
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/libgd/libgd/commit/39abd7238cea2ba8baa4bcac1d6fc01c6cb8afab
Upstream-Status: Backport

gdImageSetInterpolationMethod() rejected the bicubic methods, so PHP's
imagesetinterpolation(IMG_BICUBIC) failed and imagescale() with it returned
false (ext/gd tests bug79676, bug73272, imageinterpolation_basic,
imagescale_preserve_ratio, which fail the same way without Fil-C).

--- a/src/gd_interpolation.c
+++ b/src/gd_interpolation.c
@@ -2264,6 +2264,11 @@ BGD_DECLARE(int) gdImageSetInterpolationMethod(gdImagePtr im, gdInterpolationMet
 		case GD_BESSEL:
 			im->interpolation = filter_bessel;
 			break;
+		case GD_BICUBIC_FIXED:
+		case GD_BICUBIC:
+			/* no interpolation as gdImageScale calls a dedicated function */
+			im->interpolation = NULL;
+			break;
 		case GD_BLACKMAN:
 			im->interpolation = filter_blackman;
 			break;
